<title>USA: GeoWaste to gain $675,000 from land sale.</title>
<headline>GeoWaste to gain $675,000 from land sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>GeoWaste Inc said Thursday it will receive $657,000 from a land sale by its 75 percent-owned partnership Uintah Basin LP.</p>
<p>GeoWaste said its interest in the property is carried on the company's balance sheet at a book value of $300,000.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the resulting gain would be reported with the company's fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>GeoWaste said Unitah sold 19,200 acres in Utah's Uintah County which was not related to the company's waste disposal business.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
